#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A table of the language features included in OpenQASM 3."
msgstr "Un tableau des fonctionnalités du langage OpenQASM 3."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenQASM 3 feature table"
msgstr "Tableau des fonctionnalités OpenQASM 3"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore negctrl, durationof, vstring */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore negctrl, durationof, vstring */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenQASM 3 feature table {#openqasm-3-feature-table}"
msgstr "Tableau des fonctionnalités OpenQASM 3 {#openqasm-3-feature-table}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Below is a list of the `OpenQASM 3` language features.\n"
msgstr "Voici la liste des fonctionnalités du langage `OpenQASM 3`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more details on these capabilities, see the [OpenQASM 3.X Live Specification](https://openqasm.com/).\n"
msgstr "Pour plus de détails sur ces capacités, consulte la [spécification live OpenQASM 3.X](https://openqasm.com/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key:\n"
msgstr "Légende :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "❌ Not supported\n"
msgstr "❌ Non pris en charge\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "🟡 Partial support\n"
msgstr "🟡 Prise en charge partielle\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "✅ Supported\n"
msgstr "✅ Pris en charge\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of the complete \"supported\" mark depends on the column:\n"
msgstr "La signification de la marque « pris en charge » complète dépend de la colonne :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Qiskit SDK*: The feature can be parsed by [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3) (by using the `qiskit-qasm3-import` extension), represented in a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit),\n"
"and exported to OpenQASM 3 by [`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps).\n"
msgstr ""
"*Qiskit SDK* : la fonctionnalité peut être analysée par [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3) (en utilisant l'extension `qiskit-qasm3-import`), représentée dans un [`QuantumCircuit`,](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)\n"
"et exportée vers OpenQASM 3 par [`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`.](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "*IBM Quantum Compute Service*: A circuit containing the corresponding Qiskit feature can be successfully executed on hardware through IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "*IBM Quantum Compute Service* : un circuit contenant la fonctionnalité Qiskit correspondante peut être exécuté avec succès sur du matériel via IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of \"partial support\" typically depends on the linked notes.\n"
msgstr "La signification de « prise en charge partielle » dépend généralement des notes liées.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "The most common method of submitting circuits to IBM Qiskit Runtime is to create the circuit in the Python-space interface to Qiskit SDK.\n"
#| "Circuits constructed and submitted in this manner do not need to be loaded from OpenQASM 3 files into Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The most common method of submitting circuits to IBM Quantum Compute Service is to create the circuit in the Python-space interface to Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Circuits constructed and submitted in this manner do not need to be loaded from OpenQASM 3 files into Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"La méthode la plus courante pour soumettre des circuits à IBM Qiskit Runtime consiste à créer le circuit via l'interface Python de Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Les circuits construits et soumis de cette façon n'ont pas besoin d'être chargés depuis des fichiers OpenQASM 3 dans Qiskit SDK.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not use OpenQASM 3 directly yourself, you can safely use features that are supported for representation in Qiskit SDK, export to OpenQASM 3, and submission to IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
"This includes features that cannot be loaded by Qiskit SDK from OpenQASM 3.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Si tu n'utilises pas OpenQASM 3 directement, tu peux utiliser en toute sécurité les fonctionnalités prises en charge pour la représentation dans Qiskit SDK, l'export vers OpenQASM 3, et la soumission à IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
"Cela inclut les fonctionnalités qui ne peuvent pas être chargées par Qiskit SDK depuis OpenQASM 3.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

